From: ProjectM TV contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Retain ProjectM TV rendering and preset compatibility on upstream master

Rebase the maintained TV renderer on upstream 6f64807467e312034883a4389e6aa80a675458bc (unreleased projectM 4.2 master). Preserve Native trails, quad lines, stateful geometry replay, transitions, resource pooling and shader/preset compatibility through upstream Mesh and instance ShaderCache ownership. Keep GLES 3.0 support and adapt external burn-in invalidation. Consolidates the renderer portions of the historical 44-patch series; upstream-equivalent fixes are omitted. See docs/UPSTREAM_PATCH_VALUE.md in ProjectM-TV for original patch attribution and per-patch disposition. No new performance claim is implied by this port.

---
